The condition on line 10 calls h, so goto conversion evaluates it into a
temporary (tmp_if_expr) before branching. The run returns on line 11, so line
12 is never reached. The merge of the return values mentions line 12's guard
and the temporary; it is credited to the temporary's line (10), where the run
left the path, not to line 12.
